[en.FOCUS_C04_HONORED_GUEST_WIND_RIDER]
Honored Guest

[en.FOCUS_C04_HONORED_GUEST_WIND_RIDER_desc]
Wind Rider’s investment this time has undoubtedly achieved great success: the business of the Cloudsdale restaurant has entered the right track; Wind Rider not only got his investment return, but also obtained the exclusive right to sell Timbucktu crystals, making loads. As an intermediary, Miss Laurette also got a small part of the commission.\nBut Wind Rider is obviously not satisfied with this. His eyes turned to the Weather Factory on the east side of Cloudsdale. This place is still under the jurisdiction of Cloudsdale nominally, but since the Equestria Meteorological Bureau was abandoned and the New Weather Lab was established, it has been managed by Cloudsdale in substance.\nUnder the increasing influence of the Windigos, how terrifying the commercial monopoly advantage of controlling the weather will be! Wind Rider will naturally not miss this opportunity. He decided to put the management of the Weather Factory in his pocket — although Spitfire seems not to want to see such a thing happen.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_HONORED_GUEST_WIND_RIDER]
尊贵的访客

[zh.FOCUS_C04_HONORED_GUEST_WIND_RIDER_desc]
乘风的这次投资无疑取得了巨大的成功：层云堡餐馆的生意步入正轨；乘风不仅拿到了自己的投资回报，还获得了廷马克图水晶专营权，赚得盆满钵满；作为中介的劳雷特也拿到了一小部分的佣金。\n但乘风显然并不满足于此，他的目光看向了层云堡东侧的天气工厂。这里名义上依然是云中城的辖区，但自从帝国气象局废弃、新天气实验室组建后，这里就已经实质上由层云堡管理了。\n在风之魔日益增强的影响下，控制天气的能力将会是多么恐怖的商业垄断优势！乘风自然不会放过这个机会，他决定将天气工厂的管理权收入囊中 —— 尽管喷火似乎并不希望看到这样的事情发生。

